Approval-First Import

Origin: extracted as a standalone implementation from the first-party TAgent
design for Skill/MCP import previews and explicit tool approvals (2026).
Relevant design sources: import-safety.ts, skill-import.ts, mcp-import.ts,
and approvals.ts in TAgent's server source.

This directory contains a framework-independent implementation and synthetic
examples. It has no runtime dependencies on TAgent, Hono, MCP SDKs, external
registries, model providers, or package managers. No third-party project source,
user conversations, runtime state, API keys, or downloaded package contents are
included. The MIT license in this directory applies to this standalone code;
it does not relicense the rest of TAgent or any imported third-party package.

Source repository: https://github.com/liulinlin718-netizen/approval-first-import
The package has not been published to npm. Examples use reserved example.org
addresses and do not contact them.
